ied from the project documents exposed to this agent.\"},{\"requirement\":\"The algorithm's latency on the Level-1 FPGA hardware must not exceed 4.0 us.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"firmware_testbench_results.md reports Algorithm-L1 latency of 3.1 us, below the 4.0 us budget.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Threshold between 20 and 60 GeV.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"The recommended threshold is 40 GeV, which lies within the allowed range.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Achieve the highest possible signal efficiency at the allocated trigger rate.\",\"status\":\"unknown\",\"evidence\":\"Among latency-compliant algorithms, Algorithm-L1 is expected to outperform the fixed-window Algorithm-L3 due to learned calibration and sliding-window clustering, but the documents do not include the required rate/efficiency scan to prove the optimal threshold.\"},{\"requirement\":\"Finish by submitting one recommended algorithm and threshold.\",\"status\":\"met\",\"evidence\":\"Submitted Algorithm-L1 with a 40 GeV threshold.\"}]}", "call_id": "call_68655a05e096417aa0c5ae022c778d81", "name": "submit_recommendation", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_0f5a3ec65293afda006b02de302ac487d0b08175e717e93c24", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}
